# BarStripeLab needs no environment variables to build or deploy.
#
# The AI style generator does not use a server-side key: each visitor pastes
# their own Anthropic key in the browser, and it is sent only to api.anthropic.com.

# Optional: serve the static export from a sub-path (read by next.config.js).
# Leave unset for Cloudflare Pages, which serves the site from the root.
# BASE_PATH=/barstripelab
